      "description": "FULLY FURNISHED 2 BEDROOM + FLEX / 2 BATHROOM SUITE IN PRIME KITSILANO – ALL UTILITIES INCLUDED\n\nAvailable: September 1, 2026 | 1-Year Lease\n\nMove right into this beautifully renovated, fully furnished 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom suite with bonus flex space (currently used as storage) in one of Vancouver's most sought-after neighborhoods.\n\nTHE SPACE:\nThis bright, modern suite features hardwood flooring, mosaic tiles, and granite countertops throughout. The open-concept kitchen showcases stainless steel appliances, while the living area centers around a cozy gas fireplace. The spacious master bedroom includes a walk-in closet, and both bathrooms offer shower/tub combos with granite finishes. Designer wallpaper and tasteful decor create a warm, inviting atmosphere.\n\nINCLUDED IN YOUR RENT:\n✓ ALL UTILITIES – Cold/hot water, electricity, gas, and high-speed WiFi\n✓ Fully furnished – Just bring your suitcase\n✓ In-suite laundry\n✓ 1 underground secured parking stall + free street parking around the building\n✓ Secure bike storage\n\nKITCHEN FEATURES:\nDishwasher, stove, refrigerator, microwave, coffee maker, electric kettle, and juicer.\n\nBUILDING & LOCATION:\nEnjoy access to the common area rooftop deck with stunning North Shore Mountain views. Situated steps from Broadway's shops and restaurants, and minutes from UBC, Kits Beach, and numerous parks.\n\nREQUIREMENTS:\n\nNo smoking\nNo pets\n1-year lease term\nSerious inquiries only. Contact to arrange a viewing.",
